// `for (mut a, b) in arr` — the for-pattern prologue `let` site — then `a = a + b`: legal, runs. ONE TOKEN from fail/bc_patmut_for_tuple_pat_no_mut_reassign_fail. PROBES.md 2026-09-06b: the by-value pattern `mut` is carried into the LIR for match/if-let/while-let/for bindings.
